== unit tests
ok - baseHpAt matches the game
ok - level floor matches measurements
   max gems a cheater could farm in 24h: 471400 (levels: 9428)
ok - level claims: order, once each, speed
ok - gem spends
ok - hits
ok - paths
ok - ledger + purchases
ok - item catalogue + mail
ok - anti-cheat: save plausibility
ok - card catalog merge fills only empty slots, keeps Drop Signal in the last free slot
ok - security panel (v995): tunable limits, config, ban state, summary
ok - v1231 daily tasks gems: 20 per task once a day, 300 chest only after 100 server-paid points, new day resets
ok - v1593 live events config: clamps, sorts, refuses gems / unknown items
ok - v1594 arena event: defaults, rank rewards, keys
ok - v1596 popup deals in the shop config
ok - v1599 Boss Rush config
ok - v1601 featured shards in mail
ok - v1617 New Player Path: defaults, np_shards allowed, bad kinds / gems / duplicate chest days refused
ok - v1618 Conquest Sprint: defaults, heroup kind, bad kinds / gems refused, needs a final chest
ok - v1621 Season Pass: defaults (30 levels, 60 premium season-hero shards), sp_shards allowed, gems allowed (v1625)
ok - v1623 Alliance Siege: defaults, tiers, rally share and bonus
ok - v1625 event rewards on the server: gems allowed in rewards, never in shops; item switches; claim plan + period + once-only + gem cap
ok - v1628 activity gems: defaults, caps per day, switch, daily task gems raised
ok - v1629 gems in the starting event rewards: same patch in the game and the admin page, every default event pays gems
ok - v1630 hero of your choice (pick_shards) in events: allowed alone or with items, resolved to a Weekly Chest hero only
ok - v1631 Welcome Back: detected after `away` days, day n opens on the n-th day back, cb_shards = the Welcome Back hero
ok - v1632 Hero Collection: steps checked against the saved heroes (stars = arms / 5), collection counts, not-yet = retry later (aborted)
ok - v1633 Seasonal Festivals: dated, no overlaps, claims only while one runs, period = its start day
ok - v1635 cards: grants extend from the current end, daily once a day while active, one pick per milestone, pass_sp = this season
ok - v1636 Hero Shop: gems taken on the server, weekly stock per player, featured shards resolved, no gems for sale
30 tests passed
firestore.rules written, admins: 1
